1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '' “Henry married https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Gardner/6000000037815016341, a sister of [https://www.geni.com/people/David-Gardner/6000000033099708923?through=6000000037815371991 dad]’s [https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/people/Gardner/6000000204224288821?through=6000000033099708923 mother]. He got his acreage plus another for keeping his widowed mother an extra year. They lived in the area from Phillips fork down to the Harv Gardner bridge. He 
2 CONC was a class leader at Hoagland Chapel after demise of High Hill. He spent long periods of time in meditation, speaking to nobody. Taciturnity cropped out in other Gardners, in cases to an advanced degree. (Not in all, however!)”.'
2 CONC '
2 CONT ----
