2 CONT
2 CONT Solomon Bowers (M)
2 CONT
2 CONT b. 6 July 1820, d. 7 April 1905
2 CONT
2 CONT Pop-up Pedigree
2 CONT
2 CONT Appears on charts:
2 CONT
2 CONT      Pedigree for Joseph Thomas Bowers
2 CONT
2 CONT Solomon Bowers was the son of John Bower and Margaret Swinehart. Solomon Bowers was born on 6 July 1820 at Bowerston, Tuscaous County, Ohio.1 He married Suanna Lawver, daughter of Adam Lawver and Susan Rutherford, on 5 July 1843 a
2 CONC t Harrison County, Ohio.1 Solomon Bowers died on 7 April 1905 at Wood, Iowa, at age 84.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a miller in 1857 at Center Point, Linn County, Iowa.1 He and Suanna Lawver immigrated in 1857 to Center Point, Linn County, Iowa.1 Solomon Bowers began military service on 4 January 1864 at Dubuque, Iowa, he served in Compa
2 CONC ny H, 27th Regiment, Iowa Infantry Volumteers.1 He ended military service on 22 June 1865 at Montgomery, Alabama.1 He immigrated in 1880 to Creighton, Knox County, Nebraska.1 He immigrated in 1899 to Wood, Iowa.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Solomon Bowers and Suanna Lawver:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Ellen Bowers   b. Aug 1845
2 CONT
2 CONT John Lawver Bowers   b. Nov 1847
2 CONT
2 CONT Isreal Archabold Bowers   b. 13 Dec 1849
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Katherine Bowers   b. Mar 1852
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Jane Bowers   b. 25 May 1855
2 CONT
2 CONT David Thomas Bowers+   b. 11 Feb 1859, d. 3 Nov 1930
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Franklin Bowers   b. Mar 1862
2 CONT
2 CONT Issac Newton Bowers   b. 8 Oct 1866, d. 9 Apr 1959 
2 CONT
