2 CONC rtha M. Bowers b: 20 DEC 1871 in Clear Clear Township, Johnson County, Iowa Has No Children Ellen E. Bowers b: 1874 in Clear Clear Township, Johnson County, Iowa Has No Children Frank W. Bowers b: 19 FEB 1877 in Clear Clear Townsh
