2 CONT # Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     "Married at 17, she gave her husband 15 children during a 31 year span. Her oldest grandchild was 8 years old at the birth of her last baby, Carrie Edith. She lost 3 other babys by miscarriage or premature birth. Four of her 1
2 CONC 5 children did not make it past their 5th birthday including little Carrie Edith."
2 CONT
2 CONT     Source: Darilee Bednar's research
2 CONT
2 CONT     1900 NE Census Knox Co., Walnut Grove, ED 117, Visit 21, lists Catherine, age 72 and widowed, living with her daughter Philena and family. Catherine had 15 children, 11 living. They were living close to her son, Howard, and fa
2 CONC mily.
2 CONT
2 CONT     1910 NE Census Knox Co., Walnut Grove, ED 126, Visit 105, lists Catherine, age 82 and widowed, using her own income, living with her daughter Philena and family.
2 CONT
2 CONT     1920 NE Census Knox Co., Walnut Grove, ED 133, Visit 65
2 CONT
2 CONT     Catherine Grim, 91, widowed, OH US US
2 CONT
2 CONT     Living with her daughter Millie and family and next door to her son, William D. and family.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Census dated January 21, 1920.
