1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From the Athens Review August 26, 1926
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services for Wiley Thornton, aged citizen of Malakoff, were held Tuesday afternoon at the Post Oak cemetery. Rev. M.L. Fuller conducted the service and the Masonic Lodge had charge of the burial service.
2 CONT
2 CONT One of the largest crowds that ever attended a funeral in Malakoff turned out to pay their respect to the venerable citizen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Per Headstone:  Pvt. Company B 8 Mississippi Infantry CSA
