1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Suanna Lawver (F)
2 CONT
2 CONT b. 5 October 1823, d. 22 January 1892 or 1893
2 CONT
2 CONT Appears on charts:
2 CONT
2 CONT      Pedigree for Joseph Thomas Bowers
2 CONT
2 CONT      Suanna Lawver was the daughter of Adam Lawver and Susan Rutherford.1 Suanna Lawver was born on 5 October 1823.1 She married Solomon Bowers, son of John Bower and Margaret Swinehart, on 5 July 1843 at Harrison County, Ohio.1 S
2 CONC uanna Lawver died on 22 January 1892 or 1893.1 She was buried at Strawberry Point, Iowa.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name was Bowers. She and Solomon Bowers immigrated in 1857 to Center Point, Linn County, Iowa.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Children of Suanna Lawver and Solomon Bowers:
2 CONT
