2 CONT      Pedigree for Joseph Thomas Bowers
2 CONT
2 CONT      David Thomas Bowers was the son of Solomon Bowers and Suanna Lawver. David Thomas Bowers was born on 11 February 1859 at Center Point, Linn County, Iowa.1 He married Harriet Gritton, daughter of Jacob Gritton and Julia Ann Ob
2 CONC enchain, on 27 February 1886 at Buchanan County, Iowa.1 David Thomas Bowers died on 3 November 1930 at Prairiebrug, Linn County, Iowa, at age 71.1 He was buried at Central City, Linn County, Iowa.1
2 CONT
2 CONT       David Thomas Bowers also went by the name of Big Tom.
2 CONT
