2 CONT
2 CONT 253. LYDIA8 TRUSHEL (SARAH HARRIET7 SMITH, CATHERINE6 SWINEHART, ADAM5, GABRIEL4 SCHWEINHARDT, JOHAN GEORGE3, HANS GABRIEL2, CONRAD1 SCHWEINHARD) was born April 06, 1847 in North, Harrison Co, Ohio, and died June 05, 1923 in Burke
2 CONC , SD. She married JOHN BOWER HOOVER April 11, 1865 in Harrison Co, Ohio. He was born August 12, 1844 in Bowerston, Ohio, and died October 07, 1925 in Spencer, Boyd Co, NB.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JOHN BOWER HOOVER:
2 CONT
2 CONT [SWINEHART by Chris Powel.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. John B. Hoover studied medicine in Ohio. He moved to Johnson Co, Iowa in
2 CONT
2 CONT 1867. He moved to Boyd Co, Nebraska in 1891. He homesteaded about one mile
2 CONT
2 CONT from Rosedale, Nebraska where he served as the local doctor and County
2 CONT
2 CONT Coroner.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Brøderbund WFT Vol. 33, Ed. 1, Tree #1318, Date of Import: Nov 10, 1999]
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. John B. Hoover studied medicine in Ohio. He moved to Johnson Co, Iowa in
2 CONT
2 CONT 1867. He moved to Boyd Co, Nebraska in 1891. He homesteaded about one mile
2 CONT
2 CONT from Rosedale, Nebraska where he served as the local doctor and County
2 CONT
2 CONT Coroner.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of LYDIA TRUSHEL and JOHN HOOVER are:
2 CONT
2 CONT   	i. 	  	SARAH SUSANNAH9 HOOVER, b. March 19, 1866, IA; d. April 19, 1866, Windham, IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	ii. 	  	*UNKNOWN HOOVER, b. March 09, 1867, Johnson Co, IA; d. March 09, 1867, Johnson Co, IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 383. 	iii. 	  	MARTHA MATILDA HOOVER, b. May 14, 1868, Johnson Co, IA; d. 1958, Fulton, MO.
2 CONT
2 CONT 384. 	iv. 	  	EMMA ISABEL HOOVER, b. August 27, 1870, Iowa City, Johnson Co, IA; d. June 06, 1942, Norfolk, NB.
2 CONT
2 CONT 385. 	v. 	  	ELIZABETH CATHERINE (KATE) HOOVER, b. March 14, 1873, Carroll Co, Ohio; d. 1963, Tacoma, WA.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	vi. 	  	IDA MAY HOOVER, b. January 13, 1876, Grant City, IA; d. WFT Est. 1877-1970.
2 CONT
2 CONT 386. 	vii. 	  	EDWARD DENNIS HOOVER, b. March 28, 1878, Johnson Co, IA; d. March 14, 1957, Norfolk, NB.
