2 CONT
2 CONT 387. 	ix. 	  	HERBERT LUTHER HOOVER, b. March 26, 1884, Creighton, NB; d. March 31, 1976, Twin Falls, ID.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	x. 	  	BERTHA CAROLINE HOOVER, b. October 14, 1890, NB; d. June 25, 1978, Denver, CO; m. (1) CHARLES FRANKLIN, WFT Est. 1904-1937; b. WFT Est. 1873-1893; d. WFT Est. 1907-1979; m. (2) JOHN HAYDEN, October 15, 1908, Ainsworth, N
2 CONC B; b. WFT Est. 1863-1890; d. WFT Est. 1913-1977.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	Notes for BERTHA CAROLINE HOOVER:
2 CONT
2 CONT [SWINEHART by Chris Powel.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Bertha raised Eddy Purviance and Lena Purviance (Bovard) stayed with her a lot
2 CONT
2 CONT while she was growing up. Lena acquired Dr. John B. Hoover's things when
2 CONT
2 CONT Bertha Franklin died in 1978.
