2 CONT Dr John Bower Hoover Memorial Photos Flowers Edit Share Learn about upgrading this memorial... Birth: 	Aug., 1844 Carroll County Ohio, USA Death: 	Oct. 7, 1925
2 CONT
2 CONT John grew up on the family farm in Harrison county, Ohio. After studying medicine, he married Lydia Trushel on 11 April 1865 in Harrison county. They spent some years in Johnson county, Iowa before moving to Verdigris, Knox county
2 CONC , NE around 1880 where he practiced medicine. They settled near Bristow, NE on a farm in the 1890's. John was a doctor and the county coroner, his son's farmed the place. After retirement, he and his wife spent some years living w
2 CONC ith son Harvey and his family in Cherry co, NE. In the 1920's they had removed to Gregory co, SD. Dr. Hoover died of heart disease in Boyd co, NE. John and Lydia had 11 children: Sarah, Martha, Emma Purviance, Elizabeth "Kate", Ed
2 CONC ward, Herbert, Bertha, and 4 that died before 1900. 
2 CONT
