2 CONT
2 CONT # ID: I17050
2 CONT
2 CONT # Name: Henry GRIMM
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sex: M
2 CONT
2 CONT # Birth: 25 MAR 1824 in Jefferson Co., OH
2 CONT
2 CONT # Death: 17 DEC 1895 in Grimton, Knox Co., NE
2 CONT
2 CONT # Burial: Grimton Cemetery, Knox Co., NE
2 CONT
2 CONT # Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     It has been proven that this family spelled their last name with one m, however, I have to use the 2 m spelling in my database in order to eliminate confusion. Darilee worked really hard to prove the one m spelling, so use tha
2 CONC t spelling when working with this family and descendants.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Some of this family and descendant information is from the research of Darilee Bedner. Her website is:
2 CONT
2 CONT     http://www.thirdstbooks.com/grimindex.html. She has done a tremendous job of researching this family and its descendants. Visit her site for all the wonderful stories she has amassed. Thank you Darilee.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Henry and Catherine Bowers Grim moved from OH to IA then on to Nebraska where they settled in an area they named Grimton (Knox Co.) Henry built the house himself leaving room for shot gun barrel holes all around it. "The barre
2 CONC l holes were used to shoot the red devils off." (meaning Indians). He also walked with a cane but didn't need it for that purpose. When asked why he had the cane, he answered with ... "to knock a few of the two-legged skunks in th
2 CONC e head" (again, meaning Indians).
2 CONT
2 CONT     Source: Letters sent by Maxine Persons to Darilee Bednar
2 CONT
2 CONT     Living in Cono Twp., Buchanan Co., IA in 1856. Lived 16 yrs. in IA
2 CONT
2 CONT     His tombstone reads:
2 CONT
2 CONT     at rest...
2 CONT
2 CONT     Dead, but
2 CONT
2 CONT     not forgotten
2 CONT
2 CONT     in the memory
2 CONT
2 CONT     of friends
2 CONT
2 CONT     Henry Grimm
2 CONT
2 CONT     died Dec 17 1895
2 CONT
2 CONT     71 yrs 8 mos 22 dys
2 CONT
