2 CONT
2 CONT     1920 NE Census, Rock Co., Kinkaid, ED 216, Visit 76, lists Howard working as a farmer. They had 4 children at home -- George 20, Allie 18, Clara 16,, and Ima 12.
2 CONT
2 CONT     1930 NE Census, Rock Co., Kinkaid, ED 8, Visit 35, lists Howard, age 69, working as a farmer. He and Martha had two children still at home -- Raymond 30 and single, and Clara 26 and single. All their children were born in NE.
