2 CONT 1. CATHERINE3 WHITEHAIR (JOHN AUGUST CHRISTIAN2, JOHN GEORGE1)1 was born 13 Feb 1789 in Monongalia County, WV, and died 01 May 1861. She married HENRY WILES1 23 Mar 1815 in Monongalia County, WV, son of HENRICH WEIL and SUSANNA. H
2 CONC e was born 16 Oct 1794 in Monongalia County, WV, and died 01 May 1861 in Monongalia County, WV.
