2 CONT 2em>> An Old Business Man Dead. New Philadelphia, Aug. 17. —(Special.)— [https://www.geni.com/people/Philip-Lanning/6000000162398431821  Philip Lanning] of Gilmore, Tuscarawas county, one of the best known and most active business
2 CONC  men of the county, died Saturday of Bright's disease, aged seventy-five years. Mr. Lanning was a pioneer of the county, and for forty years was engaged in many business enterprises. A widow and four grown up children, three sons 
2 CONC and one daughter survive.
