2 CONT 2em>> ❝ ANOTHER PIONEER GONE.  The funeral of [https://www.geni.com/people/Senia-Lanning/6000000202121137911 Mrs. Sena Lanning], widow of the late [https://www.geni.com/people/Philip-Lanning/6000000162398431821 '''Philip Lanning''
2 CONC '], pioneer merchant and postmaster at Gilmore, who died at her home in that town Monday morning of the infirmities of age, was held at West Union cemetery Wednesday.  [https://www.geni.com/people/Senia-Lanning/6000000202121137911
2 CONC  Mrs. Lanning] was nearing 90 years. She is survived by her four children, [https://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000202120821831 Mrs. Nora Moore] of New York City, [https://www.geni.com/people/Theodore-Lanning/600000020212142287
2 CONC 0 Theodore Lanning], the well known Dennison merohant, [https://www.geni.com/people/John-Lanning/6000000202121634825 John H. Lanning] of Perry township and [https://www.geni.com/people/David-Lanning/6000000202121584829 D. P. Lanni
2 CONC ng], merchant and postmaster at Gilmore, succeeding the firm of P. Lanning & Sons, where his father's early business success was achieved. ❞
