2 CONT 2em>> ❝ IN LOVING MEMORY OF NORMANDA LANNING MOORE, FIRST WOMAN BORN IN GILMORE, APRIL 29, 1849. —— DIED SEPT. 24, 1919. AT REST IN WOODLAWN, NEW YORK CITY. ERECTED BY HER SON, JOHN LANNING MOORE ❞ 
