2 CONT * C.F. Gardner’s ''c.1985, “The Gardners of Perry Township, Tuscarawas County, Ohio”, by Charles F. Gardner, 1899- , :'' (http://www.familysearch.org/library/books/idurl/1/328574) Pages: [https://www.familysearch.org/library/books
