2 CONT > ❝ Next come the (Gilmore) Lannings; the first two were buried in West Union Cemetery. Beside the church near the graves of [https://www.geni.com/people/Philip-Lanning/6000000162398431821 Philip] and [https://www.geni.com/people/
2 CONC Senia-Gardner-Lanning/6000000202121137911 Senia] a bronze tablet bears the inscription: [https://www.geni.com/people/Normanda-Rosa-Nora-Lanning-Moore/6000000202120821831 '''Normanda Moore'''], died 9-26-1919, erected by [https://w
2 CONC ww.geni.com/people/John-Moore/6000000202122214873  John Lanning Moore]. Buried in Woodlawn Cemetery New York.     [https://www.geni.com/people/Philip-Lanning/6000000162398431821 Philip] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Senia-Gardn
2 CONC er-Lanning/6000000202121137911  Senia] built a house and store on second lot laid out in Gilmore. 
