2 CONT ====Research Notes 📝
2 CONT For some reason, Charles F. Gardner has Nora’s eldest and youngest sons, John and Earl mixed-up. Unknown origins of where he came-up with their death dates/years. But Gardner also states in his intro, a lot of the information he g
2 CONC athered is “here-say” . Most of his error’s appear to be with her children—presumably them being in New York (vs locally, in Ohio) may have been a contributing factor; along with some poor transcription of some hand-written notes 
2 CONC passed along to him.
