2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?id=rdPqszLbRIgC&pg=PA163
2 CONT
2 CONT [PJD] Lo que sigue proviene del libro "WHO'S WHO IN LATIN AMERICA, PART IV. BOLIVIA, CHILE, AND PERU " (3rd Edition, 1947)
2 CONT
2 CONT SALMON TAPIA, Hugo, lawyer; b. Sept. 1, 1909;
2 CONT
2 CONT s. Jose Salmon Ballivian and Elena Tapia ;
2 CONT
2 CONT ed. Colegio Nacional Ayacucho and Colegio San Calixto, 1921-26, Univ. de San Andres, 1928-36;
2 CONT
2 CONT m. Roxana Muñoz Reyes; children Sonia Roxy, Carmen Rosario, Lilian Maria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sec., Delegation Nacional en el Noroeste, 1927-28;
2 CONT
2 CONT dir., journal of the Legion de Excombatientes, 1932; 
2 CONT
2 CONT army officer in Chaco campaign, 1932-35; 
2 CONT
2 CONT sec., Banco Minero de Bolivia, 1936-39, dir., 1940;
2 CONT
2 CONT dir., Lloyd Aereo Boliviano, 1940; 
2 CONT
2 CONT under-sec, of interior, 1940-41 ;
2 CONT
2 CONT sec., Comision Codificadora Nacional, 1941-42;
2 CONT
2 CONT fed. deputy, 1942-43;
2 CONT
2 CONT sec., presidency of Bolivia, at present.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mem. Ateneo de Bolivia, Asociacion de Periodistas, Amigos de la Ciudad, Club International, Club de Tennis 
2 CONT
2 CONT La Paz, Club The Strongest.
2 CONT
2 CONT Decorations: war medal, and two decorations Merito Mili- 
2 CONT
2 CONT tar.
2 CONT
2 CONT Address: Goytia 36 (Casilla 451), La Paz, Bolivia.
